flathub:org.gnome.GTG.description:
"Getting Things GNOME" (GTG) is a personal tasks and ToDo list organizer inspired by the "Getting Things Done" (GTD) methodology.
 GTG is intended to help you track everything you need to do and need to know, from small tasks to large projects. GTG's user interface is designed to accommodate many workflows, with features such as:
 a very flexible tagging and searching system;
 natural language parsing and a free-form task text editor;
 projects/task dependencies (infinite sub-tasks), start dates and due dates;
 an "Actionable" tasks view mode to help you stay focused during your work;
 the ability to effortlessly defer tasks to common upcoming days, or to a custom date.

bluejetty:00185395:ios.description:
Create the wedding salon of your dreams for free – hire staff and broaden the range of fashion products! Become engrossed in a gripping story full of intrigue and treachery! Open and develop a chain of wedding salons for great shopping all around the world: France, Italy, Bali and more!
The long-awaited sequel to a wonderful game is now free! It’s a cheerful and entertaining success story with different mini games. Create a wedding boutique chain and become a true master of wedding preparations: baking a wedding cake, choosing fashion clothes for guests, serving special food from the chef. Dive head first into pre-wedding fever – help the bride and the groom organize an unforgettable wedding. Open wedding salons all over the world, broaden your range of products, and train your staff in design, cooking and backing. Enjoy shopping and furnish your luxurious house in style – bedroom, kitchen, and cosy patio – with over 200 furnishing and decoration options for design.
Game features:
- 154 tricky levels in the time-management genre;
- 14 unique wedding salons all around the world: England, France, Bali, Venice, Russia, Greece, Bavaria, Africa, Brazil, Korea, Australia and China;
- Various cooking mini games for girls and boys: bake a wedding cake, cook sushi and other food like a chef in your kitchen better than in a restaurant;
- Intriguing story with sudden plot twists;
- Colorful illustrations and vivid characters drawn in one style: the bride, the groom, their families, girls and boys and other guests.
Don't wait any longer to create your dream wedding salon and become a true master of wedding preparations. Download the game now and start playing!

