bluejetty:00038881:android.description:
Moon Chai Story is a collection of exciting visual novels where you can influence the plot by making your own choices.
Immerse yourself in our stories, helping the heroes to overcome all the challenges.
In this game you will be able to:
- Choose images of the main characters;
- Choose favorites and lead their romantic stories;
- Develop relationships with other characters by choosing friends and enemies;
- Make choices that affect the plot and ending of the story;
- Immerse yourself in various worlds and genres.
Which story will you choose?
PRINTED COURAGE - Throughout her childhood and youth, Kim Sa Ran saw only injustice. First bullying at school, then contempt at university. He never had the courage to fight back. But now everything will change! The hero of our new story goes to Ukraine - to his mother's homeland.
— History in the everyday genre;
— New drawing;
— Interactive phone;
— Ability to choose gender and zodiac sign.
YOU CAN! - Norma is ready to continue the family business after returning home from abroad. But soon it turns out that the relatives were hiding a big secret, the consequences of which affect the life of the whole family. Will the heroine be able to cope with all the problems?
- Help the family cope with troubles;
- Together with the detective, catch the criminal;
- Decide with whom to build a relationship.
SYRYN - Maria enters the Syryn Academy of Wizardry, and on the very first day of school, her life is turned upside down. What path will she choose? What secrets does the academy itself and its students hide?
- Help the heroine cope with all the problems;
- Build relationships with characters;
- Learn magic.
FOREST — The forest remains the same, just like you. But what happens if you dare to change something? What can your desire cost and are you ready to pay the said price yourself?
- Choose the gender of the main character or heroine;
- Build relationships with forest dwellers or common people;
- Travel through locations using the map.

